+       Ian brought hurricane conditions to portions of western Cuba. The Instituto de
+Meteorología de Cuba reported a peak 10-minute sustained wind of 90 kt with a gust of 118 kt in
+San Juan y Martinez at 0755 UTC 27 September. A conversion of the 10-minute wind yields an
